ve":true,"bead_id":"sase-o8.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-o8[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Rank saved placeholder tags by relation, recency, and frequency[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The `<` completion menu ranks saved placeholder tags by how [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]strongly they relate to the prompt being written, how recently they[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]were used, and how often they were used, and every saved row shows [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the same compact, colored signal the history-word menu already uses[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]to explain its ordering.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]placeholder_completion_ranking.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/placeholder_completion_ranking.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-o8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-o8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared ranking-signal rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]signals_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]signals_core: extract the score meter, dominant-reason chip, age [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]formatter, palette, and colored legend out of the history-word row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]module into a provider-neutral rendering module behind a structural [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]signal protocol, leaving history-word output byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Placeholder context store[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]store: grow the durable common-placeholder store to version 2 with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-entry context bags and corpus statistics, record that evidence on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the submit and launch paths, read version 1 stores forward-compatibly, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and backfill context once from prompt history.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Relation, recency, and frequency scoring[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ranking[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranking: add the pure scoring engine that turns the placeholder context [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]store plus the prompt being edited into ranked placeholders with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-signal contributions, a dominant reason, and the evidence each row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]displays.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Warm cache, menu, and settings wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ranking[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wiring: hold the placeholder index in the app-global warm cache, feed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranked saved tags through the Rust completion engine and reattach their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranking evidence, keep Ctrl+D deletion instant, and add the two ranking [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]settings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ranking signals in the placeholder panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n  